# The container runs Linux: a CRLF line ending in tick.sh makes the shebang
# `#!/bin/bash\r`, which fails as "bad interpreter", and CRLF in the crontab
# breaks supercronic's parsing. This repo is authored on Windows, so pin the
# executable/config files to LF in the working tree, not just in the index.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
crontab text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
